WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:27.910
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:27.910 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 29]

01:35.560 --> 01:36.919
Is it held every three years?

01:37.519 --> 01:38.759
It has become a tradition.

01:39.679 --> 01:41.540
This is the very opportunity

01:41.560 --> 01:42.739
for those with evil will.

01:42.759 --> 01:45.360
This place is heavily guarded,
and the defense is airtight.

01:45.399 --> 01:46.939
There were assassins in the past,

01:46.959 --> 01:48.180
but not in recent years.

01:48.200 --> 01:50.679
Assassination here is more difficult
than in the Capital.

02:20.040 --> 02:21.199
Who are they?

02:22.360 --> 02:24.639
These are the builders
of the Hanging Temple.

02:24.920 --> 02:26.280
This is common.

02:27.119 --> 02:28.840
They will be sent away

02:28.880 --> 02:30.280
before the festival

02:30.559 --> 02:33.440
to ensure no unnecessary people
during the festival day.

02:33.600 --> 02:34.880
They return here

02:34.920 --> 02:36.239
after the festival.

02:44.239 --> 02:45.300
Never mind them.

02:45.320 --> 02:46.400
Let's go up.

02:52.880 --> 02:54.600
Why are they chained?

02:55.279 --> 02:56.680
This is an important royal place.

02:56.719 --> 02:58.020
It's never wrong

02:58.040 --> 02:59.239
to be cautious.

03:48.959 --> 03:50.079
Mr. Fan,

03:50.480 --> 03:51.600
here we are.

04:11.640 --> 04:14.280
Can these builders go home?

04:14.880 --> 04:16.039
Mr. Fan,

04:16.480 --> 04:17.639
this must be a jest.

04:23.879 --> 04:25.560
They are confined to this place for life

04:26.160 --> 04:28.360
because of a flower festival
held every three years.

04:28.639 --> 04:30.279
After all, this concerns
His Majesty's safety.

04:30.639 --> 04:32.360
Sacrifices can't be avoided.

04:33.319 --> 04:34.440
Mr. Fan,

04:34.559 --> 04:36.040
any more questions?

04:36.999 --> 04:38.079
No more.

04:38.600 --> 04:40.159
Let's get our things done.

05:07.480 --> 05:08.759
His Majesty said

05:09.040 --> 05:10.680
your flower pot

05:11.119 --> 05:12.440
should be put here.

05:22.520 --> 05:23.539
That's all.

05:23.559 --> 05:25.199
Let's head back to the Capital.

05:48.840 --> 05:49.920
What happened?

05:50.920 --> 05:52.199
Is anyone up here?

05:52.840 --> 05:53.920
No.

05:53.960 --> 05:55.380
After the builders left,

05:55.400 --> 05:56.519
the temple

05:56.639 --> 05:58.120
becomes empty.

06:00.160 --> 06:01.639
Did you notice someone?

06:01.879 --> 06:03.419
I heard noise from here.

06:03.439 --> 06:04.639
Footsteps?

06:04.960 --> 06:05.979
No.

06:05.999 --> 06:07.800
It sounded like
someone walking on tiptoe.

06:12.879 --> 06:14.800
But no one could hide up here.

06:15.400 --> 06:16.639
Could it be

06:17.160 --> 06:18.519
birds perching on the roof?

06:19.040 --> 06:20.240
That's possible.

06:21.280 --> 06:22.360
Don't worry.

06:22.439 --> 06:25.179
The Imperial Guards take over afterward.

06:25.199 --> 06:27.839
They will examine every corner
thoroughly

06:28.280 --> 06:29.920
to make sure no danger lingers.

06:37.520 --> 06:38.800
Nice view.

06:41.160 --> 06:44.159
The Imperial Chrysanthemum Festival
is held here every three years

06:44.600 --> 06:46.440
for this magnificent view.

06:47.199 --> 06:49.959
I haven't come to the Capital yet
three years ago.

06:50.520 --> 06:52.680
Your speedy promotion

06:53.040 --> 06:54.399
is rare.

06:56.600 --> 06:58.419
Come, let's go back.

06:58.439 --> 06:59.519
All right.

07:04.920 --> 07:06.920
Your inner qi flow is out of order.

07:09.119 --> 07:10.199
I'm good.

07:10.840 --> 07:13.480
My techniques
get out of control sometimes.

07:13.879 --> 07:15.079
I'm better now.

07:16.679 --> 07:18.000
I shouldn't ask

07:18.239 --> 07:19.619
what techniques you practice,

07:19.639 --> 07:21.240
but the qi flow issue

07:21.400 --> 07:22.539
is not a good sign.

07:22.559 --> 07:25.040
You should ask your master.

07:26.280 --> 07:27.299
No one taught me this.

07:27.319 --> 07:28.519
I learned it myself.

07:31.480 --> 07:33.120
How did he learn that by himself?

07:35.759 --> 07:37.120
To be honest,

07:37.480 --> 07:38.599
Mr. Fan,

07:38.840 --> 07:41.360
His Majesty treats you especially well.

07:41.800 --> 07:43.920
Postponing the flower festival
for a subject

07:43.960 --> 07:46.279
has never happened before.

07:46.520 --> 07:49.159
You surely have a bright future.

07:49.239 --> 07:50.719
You flatter me, Commander Gong.

07:51.119 --> 07:52.299
And so,

07:52.319 --> 07:53.800
you have to take care of your body.

07:53.840 --> 07:55.140
You mustn't be careless

07:55.160 --> 07:56.639
about that technique issue.

07:56.960 --> 07:58.120
Thank you for your concern.

07:58.600 --> 07:59.859
Mr. Fan,

07:59.879 --> 08:01.140
you have a promising future.

08:01.160 --> 08:03.800
I'm just trying
to leave a good impression on you.

08:32.600 --> 08:36.470
[Fan's Residence]

08:50.199 --> 08:52.040
Well, I win again.

08:52.719 --> 08:53.920
Thank you so much.

08:58.280 --> 09:00.020
Ruoruo, your money isn't enough.

09:00.040 --> 09:01.199
I lost all my money.

09:01.439 --> 09:04.179
You have to pay me
even though we are siblings.

09:04.199 --> 09:05.400
I have no money.

09:09.920 --> 09:11.119
I can't continue.

09:11.959 --> 09:13.719
I don't have money to continue.

09:14.000 --> 09:16.040
Wan'er, you can take my place.

09:17.079 --> 09:18.179
It doesn't matter who sits here.

09:18.199 --> 09:20.320
It won't make any difference. Here.

09:35.319 --> 09:36.800
Shuffle. Let's start.

09:37.875 --> 09:44.095
[Imperial Inspectorate]

09:56.240 --> 09:57.839
Why am I chained?

09:59.520 --> 10:00.600
Take them off.

10:06.359 --> 10:07.479
Are you deaf?

10:21.439 --> 10:23.680
I'm going to poison you.

10:31.719 --> 10:33.520
I will poison you.

10:35.199 --> 10:37.239
They are your men.

10:43.640 --> 10:44.920
Do you bear

10:45.040 --> 10:46.440
to poison them?

10:47.199 --> 10:48.279
Mr. Chen,

10:48.439 --> 10:49.519
never mind us.

10:49.800 --> 10:51.939
I will finish these brats.

10:51.959 --> 10:53.440
This is my order.

10:53.559 --> 10:54.920
Go easy on them.

10:56.760 --> 10:57.999
You locked me up?

11:01.679 --> 11:02.879
Eat them while they are hot.

11:04.679 --> 11:05.879
Why did you lock me up?

11:06.040 --> 11:07.120
Eat.

11:08.599 --> 11:10.479
Was it done

11:10.760 --> 11:12.199
by Mr. Wu?

11:12.800 --> 11:14.320
When you are at this age,

11:14.439 --> 11:16.040
you have to be careful

11:16.319 --> 11:17.780
with anything you eat or do.

11:17.800 --> 11:19.100
I only came back to the Capital

11:19.120 --> 11:20.920
for one thing.

11:21.000 --> 11:22.479
I want to hunt the murderer down.

11:23.800 --> 11:26.160
But I'm a little confused.

11:27.000 --> 11:30.659
We tracked down the murderer
in Jiangnan,

11:30.679 --> 11:33.959
but he disappeared
after arriving in the Capital.

11:34.160 --> 11:36.879
And the Imperial Inspectorate
didn't find anything about it.

11:37.359 --> 11:40.199
Who is protecting him?

11:42.240 --> 11:44.560
Tell me in advance what you want to eat.

11:48.120 --> 11:49.200
Mr. Chen,

11:49.959 --> 11:51.260
what are you up to?

11:51.280 --> 11:52.719
I will deliver the food to you.

12:22.079 --> 12:23.160
Wan'er,

12:23.240 --> 12:25.640
you don't seem like a beginner.

12:26.839 --> 12:29.239
I wasn't allowed to go out
when I was sick back then.

12:29.520 --> 12:32.599
So I always found myself
something to play with.

12:43.920 --> 12:45.839
Come, let's continue.

13:03.719 --> 13:05.040
What are they doing?

13:05.839 --> 13:08.419
Fan Sizhe said goodbye to Father
when he returned home this morning.

13:08.439 --> 13:09.879
He said he wanted to go northward.

13:12.199 --> 13:13.699
That's why he wanted to play
the last game

13:13.719 --> 13:15.680
before leaving?

13:16.520 --> 13:17.999
It wasn't his idea.

13:18.280 --> 13:19.620
It was Father's.

13:19.640 --> 13:21.599
Father suggested to play this?

13:24.559 --> 13:27.040
Father doesn't want him to leave.

13:27.319 --> 13:28.719
No wonder

13:29.040 --> 13:31.539
Father prepares
a lot of silver taels this time.

13:31.559 --> 13:33.680
He keeps taking out more
every time he loses.

13:34.040 --> 13:35.959
The game isn't his intention.

13:36.079 --> 13:37.599
He wants to keep Sizhe.

13:38.439 --> 13:40.999
But he feels awkward to tell him that,

13:41.479 --> 13:43.440
so he suggested the game.

13:44.719 --> 13:47.520
But why did Madam Liu
advise him to leave?

13:47.559 --> 13:50.299
I don't get it.

13:50.319 --> 13:51.560
I think

13:52.199 --> 13:55.100
Madam Liu is trying to let go

13:55.120 --> 13:56.679
so that Sizhe

13:56.679 --> 13:58.599
can experience life alone and grow.

13:58.959 --> 14:00.199
Besides,

14:00.880 --> 14:03.900
I have caused many incidents
in the Capital recently.

14:03.920 --> 14:06.160
Sending Sizhe away at this time

14:07.199 --> 14:09.320
may keep him safe.

14:11.479 --> 14:12.559
Father,

14:12.880 --> 14:13.999
you see,

14:14.160 --> 14:15.680
all the tiles are drawn.

14:15.719 --> 14:16.939
Let's stop here.

14:16.959 --> 14:18.500
It's getting dark now.

14:18.520 --> 14:19.740
Then, we will have dinner

14:19.760 --> 14:21.280
and continue afterward.

14:22.880 --> 14:24.320
I can't stay for dinner.

14:24.400 --> 14:25.380
I have got roads to cover.

14:25.400 --> 14:27.160
You don't have to go now.

14:30.000 --> 14:31.400
I will have to leave anyway.

14:31.640 --> 14:33.400
You have been northward before.

14:34.520 --> 14:36.119
That's enough training.

14:38.000 --> 14:40.860
He is all grown up
and has a mind of his own ideas.

14:40.880 --> 14:42.199
Just let him go.

14:47.079 --> 14:48.560
How about this, Father?

14:52.000 --> 14:53.359
We will play the last game.

14:53.839 --> 14:56.079
If I lose, I leave.

15:10.559 --> 15:13.160
Well, both of you are out.

15:14.120 --> 15:15.920
We will decide the game.

15:16.319 --> 15:17.380
How so?

15:17.400 --> 15:18.680
Didn't I say it just now?

15:19.000 --> 15:20.339
I would play the last game.

15:20.359 --> 15:22.640
If I lose, I leave.

15:24.000 --> 15:25.999
If you lose, you leave.

15:26.520 --> 15:29.479
If you win, should we continue?

15:30.559 --> 15:31.939
We will see.

15:31.959 --> 15:34.020
Besides, the game can't continue
even if I win.

15:34.040 --> 15:35.800
You lose all your silver taels.

15:43.040 --> 15:45.500
Father, please don't indulge
in gambling.

15:45.520 --> 15:47.419
Last time, you left to avoid trouble,

15:47.439 --> 15:49.040
but you don't have to go now.

15:50.000 --> 15:51.459
You have become mature

15:51.479 --> 15:53.440
after this trip.

15:53.719 --> 15:55.199
I will be honest with you.

15:55.679 --> 15:57.359
Previously, I engaged in business

15:58.400 --> 16:00.079
because I wanted to prove myself to you.

16:00.599 --> 16:02.240
I didn't want you to think

16:02.240 --> 16:04.119
I was a useless son.

16:04.319 --> 16:07.160
I wanted to make you proud.

16:07.760 --> 16:10.539
So I tried everything to impress you.

16:10.559 --> 16:11.879
I'm impressed.

16:12.359 --> 16:14.199
But this time is different.

16:14.679 --> 16:16.800
I'm doing this for myself.

16:17.280 --> 16:18.240
I want to go to Northern Qi

16:18.240 --> 16:20.280
and establish an unprecedented business

16:20.359 --> 16:22.999
connecting its national prospects
with wealth.

16:23.319 --> 16:24.719
So this time,

16:24.952 --> 16:27.140
I'm pursuing my own dream.

16:27.160 --> 16:28.440
Sizhe

16:28.679 --> 16:30.239
has all grown up.

16:32.400 --> 16:33.480
Fine.

16:34.000 --> 16:35.179
I will do as you say.

16:35.199 --> 16:37.359
This will be the last game.

16:37.439 --> 16:39.079
It will end when all the stakes finish.

16:52.520 --> 16:53.600
Father.

16:54.400 --> 16:58.479
Should I win or lose?

16:59.719 --> 17:00.699
Wan'er,

17:00.719 --> 17:03.100
you are disrespecting your opponent.

17:03.120 --> 17:05.720
It's not like you can decide this game.

17:13.119 --> 17:14.919
I win.

17:17.079 --> 17:18.159
Fine.

17:24.319 --> 17:26.480
And now I lose.

17:33.800 --> 17:35.260
Wan'er, can you do that again?

17:35.280 --> 17:36.360
Uh...

17:44.559 --> 17:45.679
Wan'er,

17:45.800 --> 17:47.439
you can do magic.

17:49.440 --> 17:52.579
I used to play this with myself
when I was sick.

17:52.599 --> 17:54.280
I practiced a lot,
and my fingers move faster.

17:54.399 --> 17:56.919
What an eye-opener.

17:57.720 --> 17:58.800
Um,

17:58.960 --> 18:01.919
should I win, or should I lose?

18:05.399 --> 18:08.079
The game should end anyway.

18:27.200 --> 18:28.280
Father.

18:30.480 --> 18:31.560
Mother.

18:34.599 --> 18:35.800
I'm leaving.

18:59.000 --> 19:00.080
Xian.

19:00.280 --> 19:01.360
Ruoruo.

19:04.159 --> 19:05.919
Please take care of Father and Mother.

19:10.960 --> 19:12.040
Go on.

19:19.919 --> 19:20.999
Xian,

19:21.399 --> 19:23.839
can you tell Wan'er to teach me that
when I come back?

19:49.280 --> 19:50.360
Don't look.

20:38.200 --> 20:39.379
What's going on here?

20:39.399 --> 20:39.800
Mr. Fan.

20:39.800 --> 20:40.579
It's moving so slow.

20:40.599 --> 20:41.760
Please go inside.

20:41.760 --> 20:43.379
It's dusty out here.

20:43.399 --> 20:44.740
Why are there so many carriages?

20:44.760 --> 20:46.619
All officials of every rank
in the Capital

20:46.639 --> 20:49.960
are heading to the Hanging Temple.

20:50.200 --> 20:52.679
There aren't as many
during regular court sessions.

20:52.720 --> 20:54.240
Only certain ranks of officials

20:54.319 --> 20:56.299
are eligible for the court session.

20:56.319 --> 20:57.740
Those from lower ranks

20:57.760 --> 20:59.520
can't attend.

20:59.680 --> 21:01.339
As for those who do,

21:01.359 --> 21:03.579
some choose to walk
instead of using carriages.

21:03.599 --> 21:05.960
They can grab some breakfast on the way.

21:06.119 --> 21:07.980
But the journey
to the Hanging Temple is different.

21:08.000 --> 21:09.839
Everyone has to travel in carriages.

21:09.839 --> 21:11.560
So it's congested.

21:11.753 --> 21:13.793
Not everyone is eligible
for the court session,

21:13.800 --> 21:15.599
but everyone goes
to the flower festival.

21:15.960 --> 21:17.539
Everyone shares the joy of this event.

21:17.559 --> 21:19.240
All officials can go.

21:20.240 --> 21:21.260
You are saying this

21:21.280 --> 21:22.740
as if everyone were an official.

21:22.760 --> 21:23.879
What about those commoners?

21:24.399 --> 21:27.000
They can't go, of course.

21:28.480 --> 21:30.200
Everyone shares the joy,

21:30.680 --> 21:32.119
except for commoners.

21:32.639 --> 21:33.859
The officials enjoy it

21:33.879 --> 21:35.320
on their behalf.

21:35.639 --> 21:37.480
Is vicarious pleasure
part of their duty?

21:37.639 --> 21:39.700
That's why officials

21:39.720 --> 21:42.639
have so many things to take care of.

21:50.240 --> 21:52.819
Officials below the third rank
go straight.

21:52.839 --> 21:55.539
Officials below the third rank
go straight.

21:55.559 --> 21:58.200
Officials below the third rank
go straight.

21:58.359 --> 22:00.839
Third rank and above use this way.

22:00.919 --> 22:03.399
Third rank and above use this way.

22:03.559 --> 22:04.700
Third rank and above...

22:04.720 --> 22:06.960
Don't envy them. Let's go this way.

22:07.119 --> 22:09.700
Officials below the third rank
go straight.

22:09.720 --> 22:12.260
Officials below the third rank
go straight.

22:12.280 --> 22:14.059
Except for Mr. Fan Xian.

22:14.079 --> 22:16.020
Except for Mr. Fan Xian.

22:16.040 --> 22:18.079
Except for Mr. Fan Xian.

22:18.480 --> 22:20.560
Except for Mr. Fan Xian.

22:20.879 --> 22:22.919
Except for Mr. Fan Xian.

22:23.079 --> 22:25.359
Third rank and above use this way.

22:25.480 --> 22:27.960
Third rank and above use this way.

22:28.119 --> 22:30.720
Officials below the third rank
go straight.

22:30.919 --> 22:32.220
Officials below the third rank...

22:32.240 --> 22:33.859
This road

22:33.879 --> 22:35.679
is indeed smooth.

22:36.680 --> 22:38.439
Why am I the exception?

22:38.520 --> 22:40.460
His Majesty values you.

22:40.480 --> 22:42.919
Impossible. If it's His Majesty,

22:42.919 --> 22:45.560
he will definitely get me
stuck on the government road.

22:58.280 --> 22:58.700
Hurry.

22:58.720 --> 23:00.059
Something seems amiss.

23:00.079 --> 23:01.159
Let's go!

23:01.680 --> 23:02.960
Don't panic, Mr. Fan.

23:10.720 --> 23:12.240
If there is danger, I will run first.

23:13.119 --> 23:14.379
I have good light body skills.

23:14.399 --> 23:15.700
It's convenient to seek reinforcement.

23:15.720 --> 23:17.020
Thanks a bunch.

23:17.040 --> 23:18.159
Of course you should.

23:40.200 --> 23:41.520
Mr. Fan,

23:41.559 --> 23:43.079
I heard a lot about you.

23:43.359 --> 23:43.879
[Ye Zhong]
I'm

23:43.879 --> 23:45.379
[Grand Commandant of the Capital]

23:45.399 --> 23:46.560
Ye Zhong.

23:53.040 --> 23:54.220
The Grand Commandant of the Capital.

23:54.240 --> 23:56.240
You are Ye Ling'er's father.

23:56.680 --> 23:58.800
Who is in charge of security
during the festival?

23:58.879 --> 24:00.379
It's my marital brother, Ye.

24:00.399 --> 24:01.560
Ye?

24:02.559 --> 24:03.740
It's

24:03.760 --> 24:04.840
Mr. Ye Zhong.

24:05.559 --> 24:07.439
Ye Zhong,
the Grand Commandant of the Capital.

24:07.599 --> 24:08.919
Is he your martial brother?

24:09.559 --> 24:10.720
We learned from the same master.

24:12.520 --> 24:16.119
Did my junior fight with you before?

24:16.399 --> 24:18.180
We didn't fight. Just one move.

24:18.200 --> 24:21.260
My daughter always talks
about your great martial skills.

24:21.280 --> 24:22.299
I'm flattered.

24:22.319 --> 24:23.700
Since you have sparred

24:23.720 --> 24:25.139
with my junior and my daughter,

24:25.159 --> 24:26.586
you belittle me

24:26.606 --> 24:28.260
if you don't spar with me.

24:28.280 --> 24:29.299
That doesn't make any sense.

24:29.319 --> 24:30.480
Just one move.

24:58.359 --> 24:59.480
Not bad.

25:01.359 --> 25:02.439
Not bad.

25:02.839 --> 25:04.040
Have you reached the ninth level?

25:04.200 --> 25:05.280
I'm still new.

25:06.240 --> 25:08.200
The young generations are catching up.

25:08.800 --> 25:09.880
Withdraw!

25:14.720 --> 25:16.180
Mr. Ye, did you come here

25:16.200 --> 25:17.599
just for a spar?

25:18.440 --> 25:19.599
May I have a word?

25:21.079 --> 25:22.159
You,

25:22.359 --> 25:23.520
stay here.

25:28.599 --> 25:29.720
Mr. Fan,

25:30.000 --> 25:31.520
I would like to trouble you

25:31.720 --> 25:34.059
to take care of the Hanging Temple.

25:34.079 --> 25:35.220
What does this mean?

25:35.240 --> 25:36.500
His Majesty

25:36.520 --> 25:39.819
restricted the Imperial Guards
from disturbing the festival.

25:39.839 --> 25:43.220
The area around the Hanging Temple
is heavily guarded.

25:43.240 --> 25:44.359
However,

25:44.399 --> 25:48.220
there are only palace guards
inside the Hanging Temple.

25:48.240 --> 25:49.780
We are short of manpower.

25:49.800 --> 25:51.859
Do you think
there would be an assassination?

25:51.879 --> 25:53.200
No.

25:54.559 --> 25:55.980
I'm just worried.

25:56.000 --> 25:58.339
Why don't you stand guard
inside the temple?

25:58.359 --> 25:59.660
Of course I do.

25:59.680 --> 26:00.760
The thing is,

26:01.440 --> 26:03.280
we are short of manpower.

26:03.319 --> 26:04.599
Why do you ask of me?

26:04.720 --> 26:06.780
You are the only official who fights

26:06.800 --> 26:08.679
in the entire festival.

26:08.879 --> 26:10.859
Is Eunuch Hong Sixiang not coming?

26:10.879 --> 26:12.560
Only His Majesty would know that.

26:12.839 --> 26:14.020
I'm in no place to ask.

26:14.040 --> 26:15.220
What about Commander Gong Dian?

26:15.240 --> 26:16.720
If he were still here,

26:16.760 --> 26:18.839
I wouldn't have trouble you.

26:20.559 --> 26:23.660
Mr. Ye, I suppose
this is our first meeting.

26:23.680 --> 26:26.520
I'm the Grand Commandant

26:26.639 --> 26:28.359
who defends the Capital.

26:28.480 --> 26:31.059
Unless you commit treason,

26:31.079 --> 26:33.740
we won't meet.

26:33.760 --> 26:36.139
Have you ever considered that I said no?

26:36.159 --> 26:37.239
I did.

26:39.440 --> 26:40.599
What's this?

26:43.599 --> 26:46.040
I heard that you are in deep debt.

26:46.159 --> 26:47.320
Just a little help.

26:49.919 --> 26:51.379
If nothing happens,

26:51.399 --> 26:52.139
remember to return this to me.

26:52.159 --> 26:53.239
Return this to you?

26:53.399 --> 26:55.119
Of course.

26:57.520 --> 26:59.280
You rarely do this,

26:59.520 --> 27:00.299
don't you?

27:00.319 --> 27:01.480
First time.

27:02.079 --> 27:05.020
Are you doing this
for your career prospects?

27:05.040 --> 27:06.320
That doesn't matter to me.

27:06.760 --> 27:08.879
Because you are a loyal subject?

27:09.680 --> 27:11.139
Have you heard of this saying?

27:11.159 --> 27:15.099
It's about the wind and green
and things like that.

27:15.119 --> 27:16.639
What are you talking about?

27:18.520 --> 27:20.180
These people are my soldiers.

27:20.200 --> 27:21.460
If anything goes wrong,

27:21.480 --> 27:23.139
they suffer the most.

27:23.159 --> 27:25.339
There is a saying,
"When strong wind blows,

27:25.359 --> 27:27.800
only insignificant ones collapse."

27:29.879 --> 27:31.599
"An insignificant wind stirs a gale."

27:31.800 --> 27:33.780
Right, that's the one.

27:33.800 --> 27:35.439
But you can't use it this way.

27:35.839 --> 27:37.399
As long as you get it.

27:49.960 --> 27:50.579
This isn't enough?

27:50.599 --> 27:52.919
You can give it to me
if anything really happens.

27:55.599 --> 27:56.960
Is that

27:58.240 --> 28:01.139
a yes, Mr. Fan?

28:01.159 --> 28:02.760
Don't worry, Mr. Ye.

28:03.240 --> 28:05.660
Nothing has happened
in the Chrysanthemum Festival so far.

28:05.680 --> 28:06.839
Accidents

28:07.079 --> 28:08.560
don't just happen commonly.

28:24.800 --> 28:26.320
Mr. Ye.

28:31.800 --> 28:33.320
Mr. Ye.

28:44.225 --> 28:48.095
[Hanging Temple]

28:49.040 --> 28:50.120
Mr. Fan,

28:50.839 --> 28:52.720
we have arrived.

28:54.480 --> 28:56.200
Well, stop the carriage here.

28:57.200 --> 29:00.099
Shouldn't we go inside
to admire flowers?

29:00.119 --> 29:01.260
I'm too lazy to go.

29:01.280 --> 29:02.260
Besides,

29:02.280 --> 29:04.720
can you see flowers from that high?

29:04.919 --> 29:05.899
What else can we see

29:05.919 --> 29:07.240
if not flowers?

29:09.440 --> 29:10.240
Mr. Qin.

29:10.240 --> 29:11.599
Hi, Mr. Fan.

29:12.480 --> 29:13.560
Where is your father?

29:13.720 --> 29:15.879
He is taking a nap at home.

29:17.079 --> 29:18.619
Did your father go up?

29:18.639 --> 29:19.879
I suppose so.

29:21.280 --> 29:22.760
He should be

29:25.280 --> 29:26.339
on that level.

29:26.359 --> 29:27.560
How did you know?

29:28.040 --> 29:29.800
His Majesty is on the highest level.

29:29.839 --> 29:32.379
Every level below is arranged

29:32.399 --> 29:34.399
according to the official rank.

29:55.200 --> 29:57.139
Don't worry. The walkway is sturdy.

29:57.159 --> 29:58.439
You won't fall.

30:04.280 --> 30:05.360
Chengru.

30:10.159 --> 30:11.480
Little boy, are you afraid of heights?

30:12.000 --> 30:13.480
I wasn't old enough

30:13.879 --> 30:15.119
to come here three years ago.

30:15.200 --> 30:16.359
I didn't expect this place

30:16.440 --> 30:17.220
to be so scary.

30:17.240 --> 30:18.740
What's there to be scared of?

30:18.760 --> 30:19.840
Look at me.

30:24.599 --> 30:26.780
You can see further
only if you stand higher.

30:26.800 --> 30:29.200
That's how a royal overlooks from above.

30:29.480 --> 30:30.619
Come on.

30:30.639 --> 30:31.760
I dare not do this.

30:33.839 --> 30:34.740
Everyone is different.

30:34.760 --> 30:36.899
Not everyone wants to stand higher

30:36.919 --> 30:38.660
like you, Your Highness.

30:38.680 --> 30:40.079
Are you afraid of heights too, Chengze?

30:47.319 --> 30:49.040
It doesn't matter how high you stand.

30:49.440 --> 30:51.520
It's more fun if you fall off.

30:57.480 --> 30:59.200
If I stand firmly,

30:59.639 --> 31:01.560
no one can push me off.

31:02.639 --> 31:03.760
Are you sure?

31:17.280 --> 31:18.839
Just standing firmly isn't enough.

31:19.240 --> 31:20.960
You need someone to hold you steady.

31:30.639 --> 31:31.839
You look panicked.

31:39.720 --> 31:41.040
Thank you

31:41.200 --> 31:42.560
for saving my life.

31:43.159 --> 31:44.320
No problem.

31:47.720 --> 31:52.220
May you remain healthy and safe,
Your Majesty.

31:52.240 --> 31:54.780
May the Qing State forever prosper.

31:54.800 --> 31:58.960
Long live Your Majesty!

32:06.760 --> 32:08.079
People are classified

32:08.079 --> 32:10.539
into different levels.

32:10.559 --> 32:12.660
They can climb higher
when there are distinct classes.

32:12.680 --> 32:14.099
Like you said,

32:14.119 --> 32:15.579
when one stands high up there,

32:15.599 --> 32:16.940
what they see isn't flowers

32:16.960 --> 32:18.420
but the ladder

32:18.440 --> 32:20.240
to the topmost rung.

32:20.720 --> 32:21.800
Mr. Fan.

32:22.800 --> 32:24.220
Look over there.

32:24.240 --> 32:25.099
Is it on fire?

32:25.119 --> 32:27.700
Fire!

32:27.720 --> 32:28.819
It's on fire.

32:28.839 --> 32:29.660
Look for the water source.

32:29.680 --> 32:31.079
Get some water.

32:34.800 --> 32:36.020
Hurry! Put the fire out.

32:36.040 --> 32:37.020
Quick!

32:37.040 --> 32:38.159
Hurry up!

32:38.760 --> 32:39.859
Hurry. Go up.

32:39.879 --> 32:41.200
Use sands.

32:41.280 --> 32:41.819
Quick.

32:41.839 --> 32:43.000
Make haste.

32:43.280 --> 32:44.460
Hurry.

32:44.480 --> 32:45.180
Come on.

32:45.200 --> 32:46.280
Faster.

32:47.960 --> 32:50.299
Mr. Fan, hurry and protect His Majesty.

32:50.319 --> 32:52.539
Wang, assist Mr. Ye
in looking for the fire source.

32:52.559 --> 32:53.500
Yes.

32:53.520 --> 32:54.639
Coming.

33:04.760 --> 33:05.840
Your Majesty!

33:06.280 --> 33:06.800
Get some water.

33:06.800 --> 33:08.399
I, Fan Xian, request an audience.

33:16.639 --> 33:17.619
Your Majesty,

33:17.639 --> 33:18.919
someone set fire!

33:20.639 --> 33:22.240
You set the fire?

33:22.839 --> 33:24.539
I came to protect you.

33:24.559 --> 33:25.720
Protect me?

33:29.280 --> 33:30.399
Where is the fire?

33:30.559 --> 33:31.619
It's put out.

33:31.639 --> 33:33.260
If so, who are you protecting?

33:33.280 --> 33:35.099
I'm worried about you, Your Majesty.

33:35.119 --> 33:36.439
Spoilsport.

33:38.280 --> 33:39.360
Come in.

33:42.000 --> 33:43.740
Examine every corner thoroughly

33:43.760 --> 33:45.020
for flame.

33:45.040 --> 33:46.399
Look at this flame stick.

33:47.800 --> 33:48.859
A flame stick?

33:48.879 --> 33:51.079
Someone set the fire.

33:51.680 --> 33:52.960
Something is strange about this fire.

33:52.960 --> 33:53.879
If there were really assassins,

33:53.879 --> 33:56.040
the cliff side has a poor defense.

33:56.119 --> 33:58.200
Your Majesty, please return
to the Capital to avoid danger.

33:58.280 --> 34:01.299
I have encountered all sorts of things
throughout my life.

34:01.319 --> 34:03.560
Look how you fuss

34:04.000 --> 34:06.439
over an extinguished fire.

34:06.599 --> 34:09.180
Throughout 43 assassinations
in the past,

34:09.200 --> 34:10.760
His Majesty has never backed off...

34:16.240 --> 34:18.260
Your Highness, are you not heading back?

34:18.280 --> 34:19.499
You aren't convinced?

34:19.519 --> 34:20.760
Not at all.

34:24.600 --> 34:26.060
You are defying the order.

34:26.080 --> 34:27.660
It's not that I want to defy your order.

34:27.680 --> 34:28.800
Seeing as what has happened today,

34:28.800 --> 34:30.700
I believe everyone here
will do the same.

34:30.720 --> 34:32.019
I... I won't.

34:32.039 --> 34:34.060
You are the ruler of the Qing State
as well as the people.

34:34.080 --> 34:35.780
Your safety concerns the country.

34:35.800 --> 34:37.660
Now that with this assassination risk,

34:37.680 --> 34:38.800
we will be disregarding your safety

34:38.800 --> 34:40.660
if we accept your order

34:40.680 --> 34:42.700
and not return.

34:42.720 --> 34:43.979
Loyalists

34:43.999 --> 34:45.299
will protect the emperor

34:45.319 --> 34:47.039
even if it means to resist the decree.

34:51.319 --> 34:54.640
"Chrysanthemum isn't my favorite,

34:55.160 --> 34:57.160
but all flowers pale in comparison

34:58.240 --> 35:00.600
to it in full bloom."

35:09.399 --> 35:11.120
How spectacular.

35:16.200 --> 35:17.019
Nice view.

35:17.039 --> 35:18.100
Thank you.

35:18.120 --> 35:18.680
Come.

35:18.680 --> 35:20.680
What a beautiful sight.

35:24.200 --> 35:26.240
Your Majesty,
why don't you ask the princes

35:26.240 --> 35:28.120
if they agree with what I said?

35:29.080 --> 35:31.180
Father, Fan Xian does have a point.

35:31.200 --> 35:33.260
Your safety concerns the country.

35:33.280 --> 35:34.439
We must investigate this thoroughly.

35:35.919 --> 35:38.999
Are you still grinding on this?

35:39.240 --> 35:41.039
We speak up sincerely.

35:43.080 --> 35:44.399
This is strange.

35:44.959 --> 35:46.240
How come Fan Jian

35:46.359 --> 35:49.200
has brought up a son like you?

35:52.839 --> 35:53.999
Your Majesty,

35:54.319 --> 35:55.979
I grew up in Danzhou

35:55.999 --> 35:58.439
without anyone guiding me.

36:08.160 --> 36:10.439
You suffered a lot when you were little.

36:10.839 --> 36:12.760
But your journey has been smooth

36:12.760 --> 36:15.120
ever since you came to the Capital.

36:15.479 --> 36:16.559
So

36:16.600 --> 36:18.680
the elders don't owe you anything.

36:19.399 --> 36:20.740
You are right, Your Majesty.

36:20.760 --> 36:21.840
Well,

36:22.439 --> 36:24.559
stop being a spoilsport.

36:24.800 --> 36:26.879
Today is a fine day.

36:27.120 --> 36:28.959
Let's drink and enjoy the good view.

36:29.839 --> 36:30.919
Come.

36:35.800 --> 36:36.880
Let's

36:37.359 --> 36:38.499
drink.

36:38.519 --> 36:42.240
Long live Your Majesty.

36:51.120 --> 36:53.700
I have put Li Chengze in confinement
for half a year.

36:53.720 --> 36:54.899
Are you satisfied now?

36:54.919 --> 36:56.039
I wouldn't dare.

36:57.200 --> 36:58.280
Go

36:58.720 --> 37:00.160
and drink with him.

37:06.080 --> 37:07.100
Your Highness,

37:07.120 --> 37:08.780
it's not a personal grudge between us.

37:08.800 --> 37:10.419
The one who would be satisfied
is the state law,

37:10.439 --> 37:11.419
not me.

37:11.439 --> 37:14.019
We have to make an end anyhow.

37:14.039 --> 37:14.800
I'm looking forward to that.

37:14.800 --> 37:15.560
It would take some more time.

37:15.560 --> 37:16.760
Any time now.

37:39.680 --> 37:41.200
Your Majesty,
we have finished drinking...

38:00.319 --> 38:01.580
Assassin!

38:01.600 --> 38:03.080
Assassin!

38:03.160 --> 38:04.839
Protect His Majesty!

38:04.999 --> 38:06.760
Protect His Majesty!

38:11.399 --> 38:13.100
Hurry and protect His Majesty!

38:13.120 --> 38:15.200
Protect His Majesty!

38:26.080 --> 38:27.160
Your Majesty!

38:57.959 --> 38:59.039
Take him away.

39:10.959 --> 39:13.220
I heard that Sigu Jian
has a younger brother,

39:13.240 --> 39:15.760
who left home at a young age.

39:15.879 --> 39:17.039
Hunt him down.

39:17.240 --> 39:18.919
I would like to see

39:19.080 --> 39:20.780
if these two brothers

39:20.800 --> 39:23.359
are both mentally impaired.

39:23.439 --> 39:24.640
Protect His Majesty.

39:26.560 --> 39:28.600
You are careless.

39:31.999 --> 39:35.359
Assassin!

39:35.359 --> 39:36.899
Protect His Majesty!

39:36.919 --> 39:38.620
Hurry and protect His Majesty!

39:38.640 --> 39:40.519
Protect His Majesty!

40:14.600 --> 40:15.680
Your Majesty.

40:15.999 --> 40:18.700
Why did Fan Xian
chase after the assassin alone?

40:18.720 --> 40:21.479
Why aren't you worried about me?

40:21.879 --> 40:23.700
You are fortunate.

40:23.720 --> 40:24.899
Naturally, you would survive danger.

40:24.919 --> 40:25.680
But my son...

40:25.680 --> 40:26.660
Don't worry.

40:26.680 --> 40:29.060
The Imperial Guards sealed the mountain.
Fan Xian will be all right.

40:29.080 --> 40:29.519
But...

40:29.519 --> 40:30.599
Come.

40:31.319 --> 40:32.999
Let's admire the flowers.

42:15.800 --> 42:17.080
Mr. Fan,

42:17.519 --> 42:18.720
are you not tired?

42:19.999 --> 42:22.319
Why didn't you go straight
into the forest

42:22.319 --> 42:23.839
but instead try to return
to the Capital?

42:24.600 --> 42:27.160
You were breathing down my neck.

42:27.479 --> 42:28.720
You didn't deny when I said

42:28.720 --> 42:29.740
you returned to the Capital.

42:29.760 --> 42:31.640
It means you have been in the Capital.

42:34.560 --> 42:35.819
You were talking nonsense,

42:35.839 --> 42:37.299
so I just played along.

42:37.319 --> 42:38.720
Why would I deny it?

42:39.399 --> 42:40.800
You are right.

42:40.839 --> 42:42.260
I was talking nonsense.

42:42.280 --> 42:43.580
But seeing how you react,

42:43.600 --> 42:45.140
I can confirm

42:45.160 --> 42:47.680
that you have been hiding
in the Capital.

42:48.439 --> 42:49.299
Does it matter?

42:49.319 --> 42:51.379
You know very well about
where Imperial Guards lay their defense.

42:51.399 --> 42:52.299
Why?

42:52.319 --> 42:53.459
Because

42:53.479 --> 42:55.200
I didn't mean to hurt you
in the first place.

42:57.120 --> 42:58.999
Are you Sigu Jian's younger brother?

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
